  "untranslated": [
    "pictures: src/viz.js draws one per group beside its controls, from the live WebGL scene; knobs pictures are drawn from the store alone",
    "the perf page: frame rate and shader cost for each shape (src/perf.js); knobs has its own performance page",
    "wiring on each var: uniform (the shader uniform it feeds), js (read by page code) and core (one of the main controls); knobs controls carry no wiring",
    "/goto: scroll to a progress value or shape (0.5 = midway from the first shape to the second)",
    "/mid: jump to the nearest dispersal midpoint",
    "/portal: switch the Wings Portal shape",
    "/view: show the cloud, or the bare geometry: solid, normals, xray (faint cloud over the solid), cost (field evaluations per pixel); v cycles",
    "/kits: switch the Wings Kits shape",
    "/machine: switch the Wings Machine shape",
    "/opening: switch the first slide: the sky, sky-full (bigger, closer clouds), or a raw block, cloud planet or fog wall (opening tab)",
    "/texture",
    "/flock: which flocks fly by (mixed: songbirds and geese), or send one now",
    "/inset: fit the object to the space above the footer (on), or to the whole window",
    "/agent",
    "/shot: download a high-res PNG of the current frame, sky and shape (default 3840 wide, full-window aspect)",
    "/ui: show or hide the page's UI, this drawer included; h toggles it",
    "/motion: billowing animation",
    "/quality: resolution and raymarch steps",
    "/defaults: make the current values the defaults in src/params.js (dev server only); with no names, every group; dry: list the changes, write nothing",
    "/save (built in): download the whole configuration as a JSON file",
    "/load (built in): load a saved configuration file",
    "/reset (built in): reset every variable to its default, or just one var or group"
  ],
